#: data/maps/Route120/scripts.inc:362
msgctxt "Route120_Text_StevenGreeting"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: Hm? {PLAYER}{KUN}, hi.\n"
"It's been a while.\p"
"There's something here that you can't\n"
"see, right?\p"
"Now, if I were to use this device on\n"
"the invisible obstacle…\p"
"No, no. Rather than describing it,\n"
"I should just show you.\l"
"That would be more fun.\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, are your POKéMON ready for\n"
"battle?$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：嗯？{PLAYER}{KUN}，你好。\n"
"好久不见了。\p"
"这里有你看不见的东西，\n"
"对吧？\p"
"那么，如果我对这个看不见的\n"
"障碍物使用这个装置的话……\p"
"不，不。与其解释，\n"
"不如直接让你看看。\l"
"那样更有趣。\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，你的宝可梦\n"
"准备好对战了吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route120/scripts.inc:375
msgctxt "Route120_Text_StevenIllWaitHere"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: No?\p"
"I'll wait here, so you can get ready.$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：还没有吗？\p"
"我在这里等你，你去准备吧。$"

#: data/maps/Route120/scripts.inc:379
msgctxt "Route120_Text_StevenReadyForBattle"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: {PLAYER}{KUN}, are your POKéMON\n"
"ready for battle?$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：{PLAYER}{KUN}，你的宝可梦\n"
"准备好对战了吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route120/scripts.inc:383
msgctxt "Route120_Text_StevenShowMeYourPower"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: {PLAYER}{KUN}, show me your true\n"
"power as a TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：{PLAYER}{KUN}，让我看看\n"
"你作为训练家真正的实力吧！$"

#: data/maps/Route120/scripts.inc:387
msgctxt "Route120_Text_StevenUsedDevonScope"
msgid ""
"STEVEN used the DEVON SCOPE.\p"
"An invisible POKéMON became completely\n"
"visible!\p"
"The startled POKéMON attacked!$"
msgstr ""
"大吾使用了得文侦测镜。\p"
"看不见的宝可梦\n"
"完全现出了身形！\p"
"受到惊吓的宝可梦发起了攻击！$"

#: data/maps/Route120/scripts.inc:393
msgctxt "Route120_Text_StevenGiveDevonScope"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: I see…\n"
"Your battle style is intriguing.\p"
"Your POKéMON have obviously grown\n"
"since I first met you in DEWFORD.\p"
"I'd like you to have this\n"
"DEVON SCOPE.\p"
"Who knows, there may be other\n"
"concealed POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：原来如此……\n"
"你的对战风格很有意思。\p"
"和我在武斗镇第一次见到你时相比，\n"
"你的宝可梦明显成长了。\p"
"我想把这个得文侦测镜\n"
"送给你。\p"
"说不定还有其他\n"
"隐藏起来的宝可梦呢。$"

#: data/maps/Route120/scripts.inc:403
msgctxt "Route120_Text_StevenGoodbye"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: {PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
"I enjoy seeing POKéMON and TRAINERS\n"
"who strive together.\p"
"I think you're doing great.\p"
"Well, let's meet again somewhere.$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：{PLAYER}{KUN}。\p"
"我喜欢看到宝可梦和训练家\n"
"一起努力的样子。\p"
"我觉得你做得很好。\p"
"那么，我们在某个地方再见吧。$"

#: data/maps/Route120/scripts.inc:410
msgctxt "Kecleon_Text_SomethingUnseeable"
msgid "Something unseeable is in the way.$"
msgstr "有什么看不见的东西挡住了去路。$"

#: data/maps/Route120/scripts.inc:413
msgctxt "Kecleon_Text_WantToUseDevonScope"
msgid ""
"Something unseeable is in the way.\p"
"Want to use the DEVON SCOPE?$"
msgstr ""
"有什么看不见的东西挡住了去路。\p"
"要使用得文侦测镜吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route120/scripts.inc:417
msgctxt "Kecleon_Text_UseDevonScopeMonAttacked"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} used the DEVON SCOPE.\p"
"An invisible POKéMON became completely\n"
"visible!\p"
"The startled POKéMON attacked!$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}使用了得文侦测镜。\p"
"看不见的宝可梦\n"
"完全现出了身形！\p"
"受到惊吓的宝可梦发起了攻击！$"

